	(text "Max Power Usage:\nMCU: 200mA |CAN Tranceiver: 130mA |Flash: 30mA |IMU: <1mA (negligible) | Total: 360mA\nBuck: 360mA / 0.95 efficiency = 379mA at 3.3V\n250mA at 5V, 104mA at 12V\n(238mA at 5V before buck)\n\n\n"
